(rectangle (start 22.86 144.78) (end 364.49 213.36) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "79360bb2-313d-5458-b7be-493b2e246323"))
(text "Rail test pads (PCB-T-02, BOM v1 line 86): the rails no other sheet probes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5a23e117-8ac6-53f7-88e3-ddd969a42ae9"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: test and debug access (BRD-040, BRD-047 must; T1-026): the BootROM, TPL and U-Boot\n   console on UART2 M0 at 1.8 V (a 1.8 V USB-UART adapter), the I2S/DSD lines at the DAC path,\n   reset and PMIC pads, the spare SoC GPIOs, and a pad on every rail no other sheet probes.\n2. Absent state: pads only, nothing fitted. The block's measurement links sit on their blocks'\n   sheets (power tree §4.12); the RP2354A SWD pads on blk.rp2354-core; one MCLK pad on each DAC sheet.\n3. Spares pinout v1 leaves without a pad (the audio-bank balls next to I2S1, FSPI_D3) carry\n   no-connect flags on the SoC sheets.\n4. I2S/DSD pads: BCLK is also the DSD clock (DSDCLK from I2S_BCLK, blk.dac-l/-r); stubs from\n   the DAC path at most 1 mm, as the coprocessor taps (PCB-A-12)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 224.79 0) (size 129.54 24.13) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c7fe9a3-28f1-5ccc-be00-af515c1c8db7"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c3f2dc58-e779-5a18-b458-6b5a74df9564"))
